          Browse our growing collection of free online calculators and choose the tool that matches your calculation needs.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-1">
          <a
            href="#all-calculators"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md shadow-blue-500/20 transition hover:bg-blue-700 active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
